  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet omfattar st&#xf6;d i utvecklingen av fastighetsbildning, registrering av r&#xe4;ttigheter till fastigheter, lagstiftning f&#xf6;r fastighetsregistrering, till&#xe4;mpade metoder f&#xf6;r fastighetsv&#xe4;rdering och&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring av erfarenheter om hur flygfoton och satellitbilder kan anv&#xe4;ndas inom dessa omr&#xe5;den.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of support to the development of the registrationof private rights to real property, the legislation framework for re- gistration of real property, support to the implementation of methods for valuation and transfer of experience concerning satellite sur- veying and methods for creating digital cadastral index maps.</narrative>
  </description>
